taskDesc1111007.en:
Increase your Realm to <g>Golden Core</g>.
Five ways to reach Golden Core:
<g>●</g>G1 Golden Core:
Required materials: {itemLink5031786}, {itemLink5031796}, {itemLink5031806}, {itemLink5031816}, {itemLink5031826}, {itemLink5031836}, and <g>5</g> types of <g>Heaven and Earth Treasure</g>.
<g>●</g>G2 Golden Core:
Required materials: Any 3 of {itemLink5031786}, {itemLink5031796}, {itemLink5031806}, {itemLink5031816}, {itemLink5031826}, {itemLink5031836}, as well as <g>4</g> types of <g>Heaven and Earth Treasure</g>.
<g>●</g>G3 Golden Core:
Any 1 of {itemLink5031786}, {itemLink5031796}, {itemLink5031806}, {itemLink5031816}, {itemLink5031826}, {itemLink5031836}, as well as <g>3</g> types of <g>Heaven and Earth Treasure</g>.
<g>●</g>G4 Golden Core:
Required materials: {itemLink1011531} or a Cloud Elixir of a higher rarity, as well as <g>2</g> types of <g>Heaven and Earth Treasure</g>.
<g>●</g>G5 Golden Core:
{itemLink1011531} or a Three Flower Elixir of a higher rarity, as well as <g>1</g> type of <g>Heaven and Earth Treasure</g>.

